:"அல்லது","gloss":"except"}],"gloss":"except","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"யாவதும்","parts":[{"text":"யாவது","lemma":"யாவது","gloss":"anything"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"at all"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"துன்னல்","parts":[{"text":"துன்னல்","lemma":"tunnal","gloss":"approaching"}],"gloss":"approaching"},{"surface":"போகின்று","parts":[{"text":"போகின்று","lemma":"pōkiṉṟu","gloss":"goes"}],"gloss":"is gone"},{"surface":"ஆல்","parts":[{"text":"ஆல்","lemma":"āl","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"indeed"},{"surface":"பொழிலே","parts":[{"text":"பொழில்","lemma":"poḻil","gloss":"grove"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"the grove"},{"surface":"யாம்","parts":[{"text":"யாம்","lemma":"yām","gloss":"we"}],"gloss":"we"},{"surface":"எம்","parts":[{"text":"எம்","lemma":"em","gloss":"our"}],"gloss":"our"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கூழைக்கு","parts":[{"text":"கூழை","lemma":"kūḻai","gloss":"short hair"},{"text":"க்கு","lemma":"kku","gloss":"for"}],"gloss":"for the short hair"},{"surface":"எருமண்","parts":[{"text":"எரு","lemma":"eru","gloss":"cleansing agent"},{"text":"மண்","lemma":"maṇ","gloss":"clay"}],"gloss":"cleansing clay"},{"surface":"கொணர்கம்","parts":[{"text":"கொணர்","lemma":"koṇar","gloss":"bring"},{"text":"கம்","lemma":"kam","gloss":"we (subjunctive/future suffix)"}],"gloss":"we will bring"},{"surface":"சேறும்","parts":[{"text":"சேறும்","lemma":"சேறும்","gloss":"we will go"}],"gloss":"we will go","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஆண்டும்","parts":[{"text":"ஆண்டு","lemma":"āṇṭu","gloss":"there"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"there also"},{"surface":"வருகுவள்","parts":[{"text":"வரு","lemma":"varu","gloss":"come"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"ku","gloss":"empty morph/future marker"},{"text":"வள்","lemma":"vaḷ","gloss":"she"}],"gloss":"she will come"},{"surface":"பெரும்பேதையே","parts":[{"text":"பெரும்பேதையே","lemma":"பெரும்பேதையே","gloss":"the very innocent girl"}],"gloss":"the very innocent girl","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"Even to the town, near indeed is the pond. / Even far, it is not indeed, the small forest river. / Except for the white heron seeking prey, at all / approaching is gone in the grove. We, our / short hair for, cleansing clay to bring, will go. / There also, she will come, the very innocent girl.","translation":"The pond is very close to the town, and the small forest river is not far from the pond. No one ever enters the grove there, except the white heron looking for prey. We are going there to fetch cleansing clay for our short hair. She too, that very innocent girl, will come there.","modern":"ஊருக்கு மிக அருகில் பொய்கை இருக்கிறது. அந்தப் பொய்கைக்கு மிக அருகில் காட்டாறு இருக்கிறது. இரை தேடும் வெள்ளைக் குருகைத் தவிர வேறு யாரும் அந்தச் சோலைக்குள் செல்வதில்லை. நாங்கள் எங்களுடைய குட்டையான கூந்தலைத் தூய்மை செய்ய நெய்மண் கொண்டுவர அங்குச் செல்கிறோம். மிகவும் பேதையான அவளும் அங்கு வருவாள்.","explanation":"The friend is speaking to the hero within his hearing to suggest a secret meeting place with the heroine. She describes a secluded grove near a forest river, which is close to the town's pond. This grove is extremely private, visited only by a white heron searching for prey, meaning they will not be disturbed by others. By mentioning that they are going there to gather cleansing clay for their hair and that the innocent heroine will accompany them, the friend subtly invites the hero to meet her there. The imagery of the quiet grove and the solitary heron belongs to the Marutam landscape, highlighting the theme of secret trysts and the intimacy of the lovers.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.44],[0.44,0.8],[0.8,1.2],[1.2,2.6],[2.6,3.2],[3.2,3.4],[3.4,3.8],[3.8,4.1],[4.1,4.75],[4.75,5.4],[5.4,5.93],[5.93,6.3],[6.43,6.95],[6.95,7.61],[7.61,8.11],[8.11,8.61],[8.61,9.11],[9.11,9.77],[9.77,10.6],[10.6,11.1],[11.1,11.55],[11.55,12.12],[12.12,12.57],[12.57,12.8]],"female":[[0.0,0.44],[0.44,0.8],[0.8,1.2],[1.2,1.75],[1.75,2.2],[